   - Concentration spikes enhance reactions
   - Reaction rate: v = k * C^2 (bimolecular)
   - Enhancement factor: ~1.001x (small but cumulative)
   - Dynamic mixing through geometry changes

3. CHARGE-GEOMETRY WORK LANDSCAPE:
   - Work = W_electric + W_bending
